              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibwakaca bakafuma, bakakomba kubusyu bwa-Jehova, elyo bakabweeda akusika kulimbabo ku-Rama. Nkabela Elikana bakaswaanana amukakwe Hana, alakwe Jehova wakamwiibulukwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
